    "chunk_text": "The Government remains committed to strengthening coordination among relevant institutions and to continuously reviewing existing policies and programmes to enhance public health outcomes, combat the illicit tobacco trade and safeguard Government revenue. Future policy measures will continue to be guided by evidence, stakeholder consultations and national priorities.\n\nThank you. \u0dd4\u0dab \u0d9a\u0dae\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dba\u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dd9\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b9a\u0baa\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bbe\u0baf\u0b95\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bc8\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd) (The Hon. Speaker) Hon. Member, it is time for you to seek a clarification?\n\n\u0dd4\u0dab (\u0d86\u0da0\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dba) \u0d85\u0db1\u0dd2\u0dbd\u0dca \u0da2\u0dba\u0dca\u0dad \u0dd9\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 (\u0b95\u0bc8\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bbf\u0ba4\u0bbf) \u0b85\u0ba9\u0bbf\u0bb2\u0bcd \u0b9c\u0baf\u0ba8\u0bcd\u0ba4) (The Hon. (Dr.) Anil Jayantha) Thank you very much, Hon. Member. Sir, I think the points highlighted by the Hon. Member are really important. Of course, now, lots of measures are being taken in that regard. In fact, our objective is to bring the informal and illegal trading into the formal mechanism. How best that could be done is a challenge.\n\nAs of now, as I highlighted in my Answer, the Tobacco Tax Act is being amended. Even the raw materials used in the manufacture of beedi would be brought under the purview of this Tobacco Tax Act and appropriate measures will be taken.\n\n1943 1944\n\n[ \u0dbb\u0dd4 (\u0d86\u0da0\u0dca\u0dad\u0db8\u0dba\u0dcf\u0dad) \u0db8\u0dd2\u0dba\u0dbd\u0dca \u0dca\u200d\u0dba\u0dcf\u0dad\u0db1\u0dca\u0dda \u0dc0\u0dda\u0dca]\n\n2026 \u0db8\u0dc1 \u0dcf\u0dad\u0dd4 06\n\nIn addition, when it comes to the cigarette market, yes, we admit that illegal cigarettes are entering the country. The Customs and other enforcement authorities are conducting raids and other investigations, but still, there are some avenues through which these cigarettes enter the market. We are trying hard to stop this.\n\nAs of now, on cigarettes, taxes have been imposed under four categories. We have identified one category where there is a particular leakage because some cigarettes under this category could be used as substitutes for the cigarettes brought in formally."
